# Protected branches

`Nidavellir` is production. `uat` is UAT. Do not push either branch directly, and do not force-push them.

Ship the change on a working branch (such as `todo`), then open a pull request into `uat` or `Nidavellir`.

```bash
# ❌ git push origin uat
# ❌ git push origin Nidavellir
# ✅ git push -u origin todo
# ✅ gh pr create --base uat
```
